  message: "Status flipped to satisfied per human approval 2026-05-12. Positive evidence (also captured in prior discussion note): the three top-FP-volume instance items the invariant surfaced — WI-gupah (Jackson 7614), WI-nutav (Airflow 4511), WI-lisov (Kafka Streams 2386) — have all shipped, totaling 14,511 within-language framework-dispatch candidates worth of FP-reduction. The roadmap-prioritization principle (rank by FP-volume on the prospector corpus, not language-pair novelty) was honored for the WI-tubot aggregate-v5 cycle. Tripwire remains in place — future cycles that deviate will surface here."  # db73
